  "body": "Adds an opt-in browser-fingerprint profile strictly for the configured PRICE_PROBE test origin.\n\nChanges:\n- new `FLIPBOT_PRICE_PROBE_TEST_STEALTH_ENABLED` switch, default false\n- when enabled, requires `FLIPBOT_PRICE_PROBE_ENABLED=true`\n- validates the configured `FLIPBOT_PRICE_PROBE_BASE_URL` through the existing PRICE_PROBE host guard\n- refuses `vinted.pl` and all subdomains\n- injects the profile into BrowserContext, but the script exits immediately unless `location.origin` exactly equals the configured test origin\n- test-only profile adjusts `navigator.webdriver`, language exposure, `window.chrome.runtime`, and notification Permissions API behavior\n- other origins keep the normal browser profile\n- regression tests verify exact-origin scoping and Vinted rejection\n\nThis is intended only for testing anti-automation behavior on a controlled test page; it does not change the profile on Vinted.",
